  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">An integrated approach to tackling drug resistance in livestock trypanosomes.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Research and development activity contributing to the UK&#x2019;s strategy to address key development challenges.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Research grant - Enhancing knowledge of the devastating livestock disease animal African trypanosomiasis (AAT). The research will provide evidence to support disease control policies. Improved control of this disease will protect livelihoods and food security for farmers and communities sub-Saharan Africa.</narrative>
